# What the vault Process receives (deploy-kit spec/v1, chapter 10, Configuration).
# The server does not read it. It is for the vault CLI a person runs in the
# pod during the handover window and after a restart: `kubectl exec` into it
# and `vault operator unseal` talks to this server. The CLI's token helper
# keeps its file under HOME, which deploy-kit 1.3.1 sets to the writable /tmp.
VAULT_ADDR=http://127.0.0.1:8200
